<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela sells Latino Seguros for $6.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Venezuela sells Latino Seguros for $6.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan Deposits Guarantee Fund Fogade on Thursday auctioned off small insurance company Latino de Seguros to Colombia's Seguros Comerciales Bolivar for 3.2 billion bolivars ($6.7 million), Fogade said.</p>
<p>The base price had been set at 1.3 billion bolivars. An auction last November was called off when no bids were received.</p>
<p>The sale is the latest in Fogade's continuing sale of assets received in return for state bail-outs to financial institutions that collapsed in the 1994-5 banking crisis.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)</p>
